# Postgres connection string for the app's database.
#
# Local development against a local Postgres instance:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:yourpassword@localhost:5432/verity
#
# Supabase (recommended for production/Vercel):
#   1. Create a project at https://supabase.com/dashboard
#   2. Project Settings -> Database -> Connection string -> "Transaction" pooler
#      (use the pooler string, port 6543, when deploying to Vercel's serverless
#      functions — the direct connection on port 5432 will exhaust its
#      connection limit under serverless concurrency)
#   3. Paste it here (or into Vercel's Environment Variables) with
#      ?sslmode=require appended if it isn't already present — the app
#      auto-detects Supabase/Neon/Vercel Postgres hostnames and enables SSL
#      even without that flag, but it's harmless to include.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:localdev@localhost:5432/verity
